### Seed check - Get CEO
GET http://localhost:3000/employees/1

### Get Manager
GET http://localhost:3000/employees/2

### Create Employee
POST http://localhost:3000/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "managerId": 1,
  "contactInfo": {
    "phone": "123-456-7890",
    "email": "john.doe@example.com"
  }
}

### Get Employee criado
GET http://localhost:3000/employees/3

### Update Employee
PATCH http://localhost:3000/employees/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated John Doe",
  "contactInfo": {
    "phone": "987-654-3210",
    "email": "john.doe.updated@example.com"
  }
}

### Assign Manager
PATCH http://localhost:3000/employees/3/assign-manager
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "managerId": 2
}

### Get Tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks

### Get Meetings
GET http://localhost:3000/meetings


